					"minor": 23,
					"patch": 0
				}
			},
			"description": "Rotoscope look: traces the edges of the incoming video and redraws them with a hand-drawn jitter, like Len Lye. At rest (Jitter Amount 0, Redraw Counter static) the lines stand still. Animate Redraw Counter (x) in Arena (Timeline, BPM Sync or FFT +) to get a new drawing every 'Redraw every x (Counter)' steps; animate Jitter Amount for how much the lines wobble. Source Opacity and Line Opacity mix original and lines independently, e.g. inverse on the kick.",
			"displayName": "Rotoscope Boil",
			"identifier": "b87edf1b-6b28-4f1d-ae02-ec5fd2362477",
